#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:5
#: d52e20241f694c0d82c2e01915339d2f dbf6b20c079a49799bd5713eb7b872c7
msgid "Terrain Following"
msgstr "地形跟随"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:7
#: 1a6e83e61d6949f3827e9dc09234643b
msgid ""
"You can use automatic terrain following for fixed wing aircraft if you have "
"an autopilot board with local storage (such as the Pixhawk). This page "
"explains how terrain following works, how to enable it and what its "
"limitations are."
msgstr "如果飞控具有本地存储（如 Pixhawk），可以为固定翼飞机使用自动地形跟随功能。本页介绍地形跟随的工作原理、如何启用以及其局限性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:11
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:12
#: 418920d14d6e456087e0ef498bbb7e5b b3ef3b0956f34978b257b5bb2e25b1de
msgid ""
"If using Copter, see :ref:`Copter specific terrain following instructions "
"here <copter:terrain-following>`."
msgstr "如果使用 Copter，请参阅 :ref:`Copter 专用地形跟随说明<copter:terrain-following>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:18
#: 54a6d467b07f47cf939e3baa91113508 eb05da0ae2ef4ec5a4bca06c750da72f
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:20
#: 2ab68c355b6c4d248a46dc295ccf0d4c
msgid ""
"Terrain following works by maintaining a terrain database on the microSD "
"card on the autopilot which gives the terrain height in meters above sea "
"level for a grid of geographic locations. On the autopilot this database is "
"stored in the APM/TERRAIN directory on the microSD card."
msgstr ""
"地形跟随通过在飞控的 SD 卡上维护一个地形数据库来工作，该数据库以地理位置网格的形式提供海拔高度（单位：米）。在飞控上，此数据库存储在 SD 卡的 "
"APM/TERRAIN 目录中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:25
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:26
#: 3da1faeae8744c2b85ae0f9ae47fc239 95efb8c367644199b1b3d22a94777fcc
msgid ""
"The database is populated automatically by the autopilot requesting terrain "
"data from the ground station over a MAVLink telemetry link. This can happen "
"either during flight planning when the autopilot is connected over USB, or "
"during flight when connected over a radio link."
msgstr ""
"数据库通过飞控经 MAVLink 数传链路向地面站请求地形数据来自动填充。这可以在任务规划时通过 USB "
"连接飞控时发生，也可以在飞行中通过无线链路连接时发生。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:30
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:31
#: 64d02045fb024e7abb6687cdcec9956c a75d729b85b740769b768506572ac04a
msgid ""
"One can directly download terrain data via PC to the SD card using the this "
"`web utility <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/>`__. See below."
msgstr ""
"可以使用此 `网页工具 <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/>`__ 通过 PC 直接将地形数据下载到 SD 卡。见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:32
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:33
#: 0b645d9a13c24afb8dc212f7c7c4ea74 af01ed7cfa3c4a119edca6c05c4c4406
msgid ""
"The data is only transferred if the autopilot has a GPS lock. So to make "
"sure your missions have the terrain data prior to flight (in case the ground"
" station is not connected during the flight and/or does not have internet "
"connection to obtain the data), be sure that GPS lock is in effect when "
"loading the mission to the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"数据仅在飞控获取 GPS "
"定位后才会传输。为确保任务在飞行前已具备地形数据（以防飞行中地面站未连接和/或无法获取互联网连接以获取数据），请确保将任务加载到飞控时 GPS 已定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:34
#: 73e1f7a17a7a4c309da50795f1b07ec9
msgid ""
"Once the terrain data is sent from the GCS to the autopilot it is stored on "
"the microSD card so that it is available even when the GCS is not connected."
" This makes it possible for the autopilot to use terrain data to perform a "
"terrain following RTL (Return To Launch) even when it is not able to talk to"
" the ground station."
msgstr ""
"地形数据一旦从地面站发送到飞控，将存储在 SD 卡上，即使地面站断开连接后仍然可用。这使飞控即使无法与地面站通信，也能利用地形数据执行地形跟随 "
"RTL（返回起飞点）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:40
#: 4975efe7123a4becbabbb15ae4cbec58
msgid ""
"During flight the ArduPilot code automatically pages in the needed terrain "
"data from the microSD card into memory as the aircraft approaches a new "
"area. It maintains an area of about 7km by 8km in memory if the default "
"terrain grid spacing is used."
msgstr ""
"飞行中，ArduPilot 代码会随着飞机进入新区域，自动从 SD 卡将所需地形数据分页加载到内存中。使用默认地形网格间距时，内存中维护约 7km × "
"8km 的区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:45
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:52
#: 877eec2e426849c1aee63f7e841350eb ca97b6d502584d988c9c205653cfdf36
msgid ""
"In addition to any terrain data for the immediate vicinity of the aircraft, "
"ArduPilot also asks the ground station for terrain data for any mission "
"waypoints which are loaded, and for any rally points which are loaded. This "
"ensures that terrain data is available on the microSD card for a whole "
"mission even if the GCS becomes unavailable."
msgstr ""
"除飞机当前位置附近的地形数据外，ArduPilot "
"还会向地面站请求所有已加载任务航点和集结点的地形数据。这确保即使地面站不可用，整个任务的地形数据也能在 SD 卡上保持可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:52
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:59
#: 624561f7fdb84d1b88a357df776b34e9 cbadbabbfd92414ca48459d5f1d31626
msgid "Terrain Following Flight Modes"
msgstr "支持地形跟随的飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:54
#: 92011c64f47d49748352c16d1958a3af
msgid "In Plane terrain following is available in the following flight modes:"
msgstr "在 Plane 中，地形跟随在以下飞行模式中可用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:56
#: cd662ebcc5bd46318fd5cb0c3b5da81b
msgid "RTL - Return to launch"
msgstr "RTL - 返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:57
#: e639331e3e8e4ea790cc88a467f21294
msgid "LOITER - circle a point"
msgstr "LOITER - 绕点盘旋"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:58
#: 5c98f686b0d547728a47e9ccde88981d
msgid "CRUISE - long distance cruising"
msgstr "CRUISE - 长距离巡航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:59
#: 5f3e6299647145bf90fdc2551c931b7b
msgid "FBWB - speed/height maintenance"
msgstr "FBWB - 速度/高度保持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:60
#: de341c97ae914ab48fed4a411115359a
msgid "GUIDED - \"fly to\" waypoints"
msgstr "GUIDED - 「飞往」航点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:61
#: 0beccaf2b10d40e7b0cc91e412322ab8
msgid "AUTO - fully autonomous missions"
msgstr "AUTO - 全自主任务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:63
#: f77e9db24d4d4fe7a47820e25013b913
msgid ""
"Use of terrain following in RTL, LOITER, CRUISE, FBWB and GUIDED modes is "
"controlled by the :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` parameter. That "
"parameter defaults to off, so no terrain following will be used in those "
"modes. Setting the bitmask in :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` "
"determines which altitude controlled modes terrain following is active. For "
"example, setting it to \"10\" enables following in FBWB and AUTO."
msgstr ""
"在 RTL、LOITER、CRUISE、FBWB 和 GUIDED 模式中使用地形跟随由 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` 参数控制。该参数默认关闭，因此这些模式中不会使用地形跟随。通过设置 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` 的位掩码可确定哪些高度控制模式激活地形跟随。例如，将其设为 「10」 可在 "
"FBWB 和 AUTO 中启用跟随。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:67
#: 53b49709809f45878765c8caa46a40ca
msgid ""
"Terrain Following in CRUISE and FBWB modes can be disabled with an RC switch"
" assigned ``RCx_OPTION`` = 86. When enabling (<1200us) or disabling "
"(>1800us) terrain following with the switch, the present altitude will be "
"the target set point either above terrain, or home, respectively. The target"
" altitude can be changed as normal with elevator whether the altitude "
"reference being used is above home or above terrain."
msgstr ""
"可通过分配 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 86 的 RC 开关禁用 CRUISE 和 FBWB "
"模式中的地形跟随。通过开关启用（<1200us）或禁用（>1800us）地形跟随时，当前高度将分别作为地形上方或 Home "
"上方的目标设定点。目标高度可以像正常情况一样用升降舵更改，无论使用的是相对 Home 的高度参考还是相对地形的高度参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:69
#: f59ca379cc3346849b0a067495032e26
msgid ""
"Use of terrain following in AUTO missions is controlled on a waypoint by "
"waypoint basis using the reference frame of the waypoint. Normal (non "
"terrain following) waypoints have a \"Relative\" reference frame, and "
"altitudes are specified relative to the home location. Not by the "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` parameter. Terrain following waypoints"
" have a \"Terrain\" reference frame, and altitudes are relative to the "
"ground level given in the terrain database."
msgstr ""
"AUTO 任务中的地形跟随使用按航点逐一控制的方式，基于航点的参考坐标系。正常（非地形跟随）航点使用「相对」参考坐标系，高度相对于 Home "
"位置指定，不受 :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` "
"参数影响。地形跟随航点使用「地形」参考坐标系，高度相对于地形数据库中给定的地面高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:76
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:79
#: 0b0c98bbe9ee4d658d9dd7cf786be4ee f39ed3cf6e9b43719ae81c67241a88a5
msgid ""
"in AUTO mode autolandings, the :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` "
"parameter does have an impact, when a rangefinder is also used. See "
":ref:`rangefinder-autolanding`."
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO 模式自动降落中，当同时使用测距仪时，:ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` 参数确实有影响。详见 "
":ref:`rangefinder-autolanding`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:78
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:82
#: 9b83f1e9b0ab4745962e89f27f72ef59 f98cf100046a45eab6c86a79ff3c837c
msgid "See :ref:`common-understanding-altitude` for altitude definitions."
msgstr "有关高度定义，请参阅 :ref:`common-understanding-altitude`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:82
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:86
#: e1daa4a55dcb4506864581c77884e469 eb42830696494efeb2f0fb1d2149baf7
msgid "Uses of Terrain Following"
msgstr "地形跟随的用途"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:84
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:88
#: 969a97a8b6a240ca996926bc6bc79199 cc58e900dd054cb7bd8913f2250241b1
msgid ""
"Terrain following is very useful when flying ArduPilot in areas where the "
"terrain may vary significantly. Key uses are:"
msgstr "在地形变化显著的区域飞行时，地形跟随非常有用。主要用途包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:87
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:91
#: aa56c34bbcd341baa7621ccc22e96c88 aadcbb3b1c69495e81c352a6777edc6b
msgid ""
"**Safe RTL**. Being able to come over a hill rather than trying to fly "
"through it when you enter RTL in a hilly area is very useful!"
msgstr "**安全 RTL**。在丘陵地区进入 RTL 时，能够飞越山丘而不是试图穿越山丘非常有用！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:89
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:93
#: ef89301c9e0e412bae4ed118453d9f24 f4cbffcad9cc46cc9c048ecbbedae78a
msgid ""
"**Aerial Photography.** It is useful to be able to maintain a constant "
"altitude over the ground when taking a sequence of aerial photos"
msgstr "**航空摄影。** 在拍摄一系列航拍照片时，维持相对地面的恒定高度非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:96
#: 88ed50d521294a2f9ea847224c8e271d d0e8a9f63f1343cd80371844fff41694
msgid ""
"**FPV flying.** When flying FPV in CRUISE mode it is useful to maintain "
"constant height above the ground so you can spend more time enjoying the "
"scenary and less time avoiding hills"
msgstr ""
"**FPV 飞行。** 在 CRUISE 模式下进行 FPV 飞行时，维持相对地面的恒定高度非常有用，这样可以将更多时间用于欣赏风景，而不是避开山丘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:105
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:98
#: a3bc85dd46884ba7b54be72f926e9b78 d0733c7465dd4c2c911014a4f66a9d35
msgid "Sources of Terrain Data"
msgstr "地形数据来源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:100
#: b1038f28ffdc4e729e6ec1e2d6dd03fd
msgid ""
"The ground station is normally responsible for providing the raw terrain "
"data which is sent to the aircraft via MAVLink. Right now only Mission "
"Planner and MAVProxy support the required TERRAIN_DATA and TERRAIN_REQUEST "
"MAVLink messages needed for terrain following download support. If you are "
"using a different ground station , in order to download terrain data you "
"will need to connect using one of those two ground stations in order to "
"allow ArduPilot to load terrain data onto your board on the ground or in "
"flight.  Once it is loaded, it is saved permanently on the microSD card."
msgstr ""
"地面站通常负责提供原始地形数据，通过 MAVLink 发送给飞机。目前只有 Mission Planner 和 MAVProxy 支持地形跟随下载所需的"
" TERRAIN_DATA 和 TERRAIN_REQUEST MAVLink "
"消息。如果您使用其他地面站，为了下载地形数据，您需要使用这两个地面站之一进行连接，以便 ArduPilot "
"在地面或飞行中将地形数据加载到板载存储中。一旦加载，数据将永久保存在 microSD 卡上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:102
#: e8d5f0c357ab4cd0b98adde68dc89954
msgid ""
"Both MissionPlanner and MAVProxy support the global SRTM database for "
"terrain data.  The ArduPilot SRTM server used by MAVProxy and Mission "
"Planner has 100m grid spacing. Unless the ground control station uses a "
"different server with closer spacing, setting the :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING "
"<TERRAIN_SPACING>` parameter lower than 100m provides no better resolution, "
"and only consumes more space on the SD card."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 和 MAVProxy 均支持全球 SRTM 数据库的地形数据。MAVProxy 和 Mission Planner "
"使用的 ArduPilot SRTM 服务器具有 100 米的网格间距。除非地面站使用间距更小的其他服务器，否则将 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING <TERRAIN_SPACING>` 参数设置低于 100 米无法提供更高分辨率，只会占用更多 SD "
"卡空间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:104
#: 63b824948e904948bad5f512c225f283
msgid ""
"Terrain Data is downloaded any time you save or connect with a loaded "
"mission with these ground stations, or, if flying, the autopilot will "
"request data if it's flying into an area not already downloaded, assuming "
"the ground station can provide it. Usually an internet connection is "
"required by the ground station."
msgstr ""
"只要通过这些地面站保存或连接加载了任务，就会随时下载地形数据；如果在飞行中，飞控将在飞入尚未下载的区域时请求数据，前提是地面站能够提供数据。通常地面站需要互联网连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:106
#: 995b240d255c4ef590920455a58491a6
msgid ""
"While the autopilot will request the terrain data around waypoints and home "
"location, if it is not connected to a GCS that can supply enroute tiles, the"
" autopilot just interpolates between waypoint's terrain elevation. See "
"below:"
msgstr "虽然飞控会请求航点和 Home 位置附近的地形数据，但若未连接能够提供途经瓦片数据的地面站，飞控只会在航点地形高度之间进行插值。见下文："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:109
#: 0be9e94a5d73458991eb2e1cd0577038
msgid ""
"If you are not flying with a GCS that can fetch and supply terrain data as "
"the vehicles flies between waypoints, the you may need to load terrain data "
"covering the flight route and/or area for RTL paths manually."
msgstr "如果飞行时使用的地面站无法在飞机在航点间飞行时获取和提供地形数据，则可能需要手动加载覆盖飞行路线和/或 RTL 路径区域的地形数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:111
#: 0b4d0aec1655487a92eb78a5cc86546f
msgid ""
"You can download a set of terrain data tiles for any anticipated flight area"
" using this `web utility <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/>`__."
msgstr "可使用此 `网页工具 <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/>`__ 下载任何预期飞行区域的一组地形数据瓦片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:115
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:144
#: 24c4f9c47f86441ba847e8a5de09271b e71c5395e3a2416a85f9ee942aa75c39
msgid ""
"It will create tiles for the specified radius around a geographic location. "
"Then you can download them, unzip and write in the APM/TERRAIN folder of the"
" SD card."
msgstr "它将为指定地理位置周围的半径范围创建分块数据。然后您可以下载、解压并写入 SD 卡的 APM/TERRAIN 文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:117
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:146
#: 83e831bbbdff47b4bb02b5c5e9d5c0cd ec3ff5990e9e42e2a7f2b629252b05e6
msgid ""
"You can also download .zip files for entire continents, or individual tiles "
"from `here <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/continentsdat3/>`__."
msgstr ""
"也可从 `此处 <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/continentsdat3/>`__ 下载整个大洲或单个瓦片的 .zip"
" 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:120
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:155
#: 3297c2b0d1c845e6b882b3b90a3f60fc d72a7e0f6365445a867b39770691cb0b
msgid "Terrain Spacing"
msgstr "地形间距"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:122
#: d8a8988064344385b7b97db881ad0a08
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot terrain code has a user settable parameter called "
":ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` which controls the grid spacing "
"which is used for requests for terrain data from the aircraft to the ground "
"station. The default :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` is 100 meters, "
"but users may set a different grid spacing for specialist applications."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 地形代码有一个用户可设置的参数 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>`，用于控制飞机向地面站请求地形数据时使用的网格间距。默认 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` 为 100 米，用户可为特殊应用设置不同的网格间距。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:128
#: 6e0b555979854fbaabcce14abcab5c2c
msgid ""
"Note that the amount of terrain data kept in memory is directly related to "
"the grid spacing. If you decrease the ``TERRAIN_SPACING`` by a factor of 2 "
"then the amount of terrain area kept in memory is reduced by a factor of 4. "
"It is recommended that you use a ``TERRAIN_SPACING`` of 100 meters to "
"prevent the aircraft running off the side of a grid in flight and not having"
" data available."
msgstr ""
"请注意，内存中保存的地形数据量与网格间距直接相关。若将 ``TERRAIN_SPACING`` 减小 2 倍，内存中保存的地形区域将减少 4 "
"倍。建议使用 100 米的 ``TERRAIN_SPACING``，以防止飞机在飞行中偏出网格边界而无法获取数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:135
#: 7eb681ac2e67431bb4f26a7122f75f7e
msgid ""
"If the ground station does not have terrain data available at the resolution"
" requested by the aircraft then the ground station will interpolate as "
"necessary to provide the requested grid size. Currently, MAVPRoxy and "
"Mission Planner can only provide data down to 100m spacing."
msgstr ""
"若地面站没有飞机请求分辨率的地形数据，地面站将根据需要进行插值以提供所需的网格尺寸。目前，MAVProxy 和 Mission Planner "
"只能提供最低 100 米间距的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:140
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:206
#: 33c841ba5ea647998edcb88c34e37ca8 3d00ed4e4f2b46a1b34ce77661b9d11d
msgid "Terrain Accuracy"
msgstr "地形精度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:142
#: a80440f7c4a344988bca12e7bbc46a0f
msgid ""
"The accuracy of the SRTM database varies over the surface of the earth. "
"Typical accuracy is around 10 to 20 meters, although some areas are worse. "
"This makes terrain following suitable for aircraft that are flying at "
"altitudes of 60 meters or more. Using terrain data for low flights is not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"SRTM 数据库的精度因地球表面位置而异，典型精度约为 10 至 20 米，部分区域更差。这使得地形跟随适用于在 60 "
"米或以上高度飞行的飞机。不建议将地形数据用于低空飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:149
#: 54cd3159bba34a528e75a7ba142d3cb4
msgid "Setting up for terrain following"
msgstr "地形跟随配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:151
#: 6f2e78f90cd64d7b900e189a5a1e5aa9
msgid ""
"To setup your fixed wing aircraft for terrain following follow these steps"
msgstr "要为固定翼飞机配置地形跟随，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:154
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:240
#: 2b5d7027750b4e1a812c3f0ae10ed3d0 ce429d816a3c44a29409852ce5d1630c
msgid "make sure you have the latest MissionPlanner installed"
msgstr "确保已安装最新版 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:155
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:241
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:279
#: 670ca8256aae4489bd768060d90661e8 d23598de00844d128e0560ee4bfc2050
#: d90ee78258404af589a13444f271890c
msgid ""
"set :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` to 1 and "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` to 1"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` 设为 "
"1，:ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` 设为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:156
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:242
#: 2edb9109ca964d83a514765bfccf71fd 41f43b59d2304578b2132edbd21db392
msgid "connect to your vehicle over USB when you have GPS lock"
msgstr "在 GPS 已定位时通过 USB 连接飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:157
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:243
#: 69e7e5724c534627a1f5299a0eedbe09 900f6d4dc1054e48960c5f2c54f69305
msgid ""
"check the FlightData->Status page in MissionPlanner and look for the terrain"
" status data:"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 的 FlightData->Status 页面查看地形状态数据："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:163
#: a480f052242049759470429ba9b4ba48
msgid ""
"When the autopilot has finished loading terrain data you should see "
"\"ter_pend\" goes to zero and the current terrain altitude in meters showing"
" up in \"ter_alt\". The \"ter_pend\" value is the number of terrain blocks "
"that the autopilot is waiting to load from the ground station."
msgstr ""
"当飞控完成地形数据加载后，应看到 「ter_pend」 降至零，且 「ter_alt」 中显示当前地形高度（单位：米）。「ter_pend」 "
"值为飞控等待从地面站加载的地形块数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:169
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:263
#: 48e6bddb3a9f4c0b98160ab130884f72 78830cd60f9f4051b5c53195f24206b2
msgid "Terrain Look-ahead"
msgstr "地形前瞻"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:171
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:265
#: 1401e30175a240ebba08b28f76de48cc f51f19506f0b4d7e81bbd0c0e291e395
msgid ""
"The terrain following code \"looks ahead\" of the current position along the"
" flight path to try to ensure that the aircraft climbs soon enough to avoid "
"upcoming terrain. The amount of look-ahead is controlled by the "
":ref:`TERRAIN_LOOKAHD<TERRAIN_LOOKAHD>` parameter, which defaults to 2000 "
"meters. The look-ahead is also limited by the distance to the next waypoint "
"in AUTO mode, so you need to ensure that you don't have any legs of your "
"mission which include climb rates your aircraft cannot achieve."
msgstr ""
"地形跟随代码会沿飞行路径对当前位置进行「前瞻」，以确保飞机能够及时爬升以避开前方地形。前瞻量由 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_LOOKAHD<TERRAIN_LOOKAHD>` 参数控制，默认值为 2000 米。在 AUTO "
"模式下，前瞻量还受下一个航点距离限制，因此需要确保任务中没有飞机无法实现所需爬升率的航段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:182
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:273
#: 4db9ad22be9046ab9ccfc4c25e09ec76 50e7b4b9029a425081cacdf1a2373ca9
msgid "The climb rate used in the terrain look-ahead is based on the"
msgstr "地形前瞻中使用的爬升率基于"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:180
#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:274
#: a93cbac898d74c45acf9dd54afbbb55c cc12cec6642e4a1bbeabe08997fa37a2
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` parameter, combined with your current "
"ground speed."
msgstr ":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` 参数，结合当前地速。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:7
#: 22be302b26244f4393634c1e33de63d0
msgid ""
"You can use automatic terrain following for fixed wing aircraft. This page "
"explains how terrain following works, how to enable it and what its "
"limitations are."
msgstr "固定翼飞机可以使用自动地形跟随。本页说明地形跟随的工作原理、启用方法及其局限性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:19
#: 963638df945c4e7db454f8cde758092b
msgid ""
"Terrain following works by maintaining a terrain database on the autopilot "
"which gives the terrain height in meters above sea level for a grid of "
"geographic locations."
msgstr "地形跟随的工作方式是在飞控上维护一个地形数据库，该数据库给出地理位置网格上各点的地形海拔高度（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:22
#: 3e86ae83856a40998d94d620ad021c78
msgid ""
"If the autopilot has a microSD card this database is stored in the "
"APM/TERRAIN directory on the microSD card."
msgstr "如果飞控有 microSD 卡，该数据库存储在 microSD 卡的 APM/TERRAIN 目录中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:23
#: f6cb2d5a69d1444ea3b3114c80359d83
msgid ""
"If the autopilot does not have a microSD card, there is an option to enable "
"data to be retrieved directly from the GCS into RAM on the autopilot"
msgstr "如果飞控没有 microSD 卡，有一个选项可以启用直接从地面站获取数据到飞控的 RAM 中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:24
#: 1c44b3725cfe49549a0cc776dac8694a
msgid ""
"On SITL the database is stored in the ./terrain folder relative to the "
"directory where the SITL process is running"
msgstr "在 SITL 上，数据库存储在相对于 SITL 进程运行目录的 ./terrain 文件夹中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:36
#: 4e4238e71ebe48fca78be45e7f940ce4
msgid "SD Card support for Terrain data"
msgstr "地形数据的 SD 卡支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:38
#: 0a48a5c6d1594685a48eef3219d222f5
msgid ""
"Terrain following works best if the autopilot has an onboard SD card for "
"storage."
msgstr "如果飞控带有用于存储的板载 SD 卡，地形跟随的效果最佳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:40
#: 72890414ea4844e4a3566bea93629d4e
msgid ""
"Once the terrain data is sent from the GCS to the autopilot it is stored on "
"the microSD card, so that it is available even when the GCS is not "
"connected. This makes it possible for an autopilot with an SD card to use "
"terrain data to perform a terrain following RTL (Return To Launch) even when"
" it is not able to talk to the ground station."
msgstr ""
"地形数据从地面站发送到飞控后会存储在 microSD 卡上，因此即使地面站未连接也可使用。这使带 SD "
"卡的飞控即使无法与地面站通信，也能利用地形数据执行地形跟随的 RTL（返航）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:46
#: de8d542c3b6144af9d45d31a28b529ce
msgid ""
"During flight the ArduPilot code automatically pages in the needed terrain "
"data from the microSD card into memory as the aircraft approaches a new "
"area. By default it maintains an area of about 7km by 8km in memory if the "
"default terrain grid spacing (100m) is used. See below for options to change"
" the default behaviour."
msgstr ""
"飞行过程中，当飞机接近新区域时，ArduPilot 代码会自动将所需的地形数据从 microSD 卡分页载入内存。使用默认地形网格间距（100 "
"米）时，默认在内存中保持约 7 公里 × 8 公里的区域。修改默认行为的选项见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:61
#: 18168e225c724778b03b403389ac6df9
msgid ""
"Use of terrain following in specific flight modes is controlled by the "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` parameter. That parameter defaults to "
"off, so no terrain following will be used in those modes. Setting the "
"bitmask in :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` determines which altitude "
"controlled modes terrain following is active. For example, setting it to "
"\"10\" enables following in FBWB and AUTO. Setting it to \"1\" enables it in"
" all available modes."
msgstr ""
"特定飞行模式中是否使用地形跟随由 :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` "
"参数控制。该参数默认为关闭，因此这些模式中不会使用地形跟随。设置 :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` "
"中的位掩码可决定地形跟随在哪些高度控制模式下生效。例如，设为“10”可在 FBWB 和 AUTO 中启用跟随；设为“1”则在所有可用模式中启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:66
#: 3e1e21c7b281456eb211459210ba73e0
msgid ""
"Terrain Following in non auto modes can be disabled with an RC switch "
"assigned ``RCx_OPTION`` = 86. When enabling (<1200us) or disabling (>1800us)"
" terrain following with the switch, the present altitude will be used as the"
" target set point either above terrain, or home, respectively. The target "
"altitude can be changed as normal with elevator whether the altitude "
"reference being used is above home or above terrain."
msgstr ""
"非自动模式下的地形跟随可通过分配了 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 86 "
"的遥控开关禁用。用该开关启用（<1200us）或禁用（>1800us）地形跟随时，当前高度将分别作为相对地形或相对 home "
"的目标设定点。无论所用高度基准是相对 home 还是相对地形，都可照常用升降舵改变目标高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:72
#: 9fb81a6f39a14aa28796e33d88eff0cb
msgid ""
"Use of terrain following in AUTO missions is controlled on a waypoint by "
"waypoint basis using the reference frame of the waypoint. Normal (non "
"terrain following) waypoints have a \"Relative\" reference frame, and "
"altitudes are specified relative to the home location, not by the "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` parameter. Terrain following waypoints"
" have a \"Terrain\" reference frame, and altitudes are relative to the "
"ground level given in the terrain database."
msgstr ""
"AUTO 任务中是否使用地形跟随按航点逐个控制，由航点的参考坐标系决定。普通（非地形跟随）航点使用“Relative”参考系，高度相对于 home "
"位置指定，而不由 :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` "
"参数决定。地形跟随航点使用“Terrain”参考系，高度相对于地形数据库给出的地面高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:99
#: f3c314cbcca143ea82f18acb6b8b002c
msgid ""
"**Regulatory Compliance.** Many countries have restrictions on the altitude "
"drones must fly at or below, often 400' (about 120m). With terrain following"
" enabled, missions items and other limits can be specified in AGL (terrain) "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"**法规合规。** 许多国家限制无人机必须在某一高度或以下飞行，通常为 400 英尺（约 120 米）。启用地形跟随后，任务项和其他限制可以用 "
"AGL（地形）坐标系指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:107
#: c77ea957fe3145f4a13526bbb1935cf9
msgid ""
"The ground station is normally responsible for providing the raw terrain "
"data which is sent to the aircraft via MAVLink. Mission Planner, "
"QGroundControl, SiYi UniGCS and MAVProxy support the required TERRAIN_DATA "
"and TERRAIN_REQUEST MAVLink messages needed for terrain following download "
"support."
msgstr ""
"地面站通常负责提供原始地形数据，并通过 MAVLink 发送给飞机。Mission Planner、QGroundControl、SiYi UniGCS"
" 和 MAVProxy 支持地形跟随下载所需的 TERRAIN_DATA 和 TERRAIN_REQUEST MAVLink 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:111
#: 7eff08daed9047bea122f0df88a0f88c
msgid ""
"Mission Planner and MAVProxy supply the ArduPilot JAXA ALOS sourced data for"
" 100m and 30m spacing"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 和 MAVProxy 提供 ArduPilot 源自 JAXA ALOS 的 100 米和 30 米间距数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:112
#: 7928366df4954ec3868682b0b478e6c3
msgid ""
"QGroundControl supplies COP30 (Copernicus DEM - Global and European Digital "
"Elevation Model) sourced data for 100m and 30m spacing"
msgstr ""
"QGroundControl 提供源自 COP30（Copernicus DEM，全球及欧洲数字高程模型）的 100 米和 30 米间距数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:113
#: c3a89cde4feb46ebba46c2c644104b9d
msgid ""
"SiYi UniGCS supplies terrain data (NASA - SRTM Shuttle Radar Topography "
"Mission Global 1 arc second V003) for 100m and 30m spacing"
msgstr ""
"SiYi UniGCS 提供 100 米和 30 米间距的地形数据（NASA - SRTM Shuttle Radar Topography "
"Mission Global 1 arc second V003）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:116
#: 7bbaa84df1804a9aabc7365580b94e04
msgid ""
"SiYi terrain data: NASA JPL. (2013). *NASA Shuttle Radar Topography Mission "
"Global 1 arc second V003* \\[Data set\\]. `NASA Earth Sciences Data Sets "
"<https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/catalog/lpcloud-srtmgl1-003>`__"
msgstr ""
"SiYi 地形数据：NASA JPL. (2013). *NASA Shuttle Radar Topography Mission Global 1 "
"arc second V003* \\[Data set\\]. `NASA Earth Sciences Data Sets "
"<https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/catalog/lpcloud-srtmgl1-003>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:118
#: 1eba52b692264ca7b9a9fca0a9e37775
msgid ""
"If you are using a different ground station that doesn't support "
"TERRAIN_REQUEST and TERRAIN_DATA, in order to download terrain data you will"
" need to to either pre-load the data on your SD card or connect using one of"
" the above stations in order to allow ArduPilot to load terrain data onto "
"your board on the ground or in flight. Once terrain data is loaded, it is "
"saved permanently on the microSD card."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用的其他地面站不支持 TERRAIN_REQUEST 和 TERRAIN_DATA，那么要下载地形数据，你需要将数据预先载入 SD "
"卡，或使用上述地面站之一连接，让 ArduPilot 在地面或飞行中将地形数据加载到板卡上。地形数据一经加载，就会永久保存在 microSD 卡上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:123
#: f8d686ed9389490482acb1bbc5b21f48
msgid ""
"Unless the ground control station uses a different server with support for "
"different spacing, setting the :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING <TERRAIN_SPACING>` "
"parameter other than 100m or 30m provides no better resolution, and only "
"consumes more space on the SD card."
msgstr ""
"除非地面站使用支持其他间距的不同服务器，否则将 :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING <TERRAIN_SPACING>` 参数设为 100 米或"
" 30 米以外的值不会带来更高的分辨率，只会占用更多 SD 卡空间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:126
#: 461cfd0b6d3f42cfa3fecfe4204bda12
msgid ""
"Terrain Data is downloaded any time you save or connect with a loaded "
"mission with these ground stations or, if flying, the autopilot will request"
" data if it's flying into an area not already downloaded, assuming the "
"ground station can provide it. The ground station may have it's own cache of"
" previously requested data, but if if flying in an area where there is no "
"cached data, an internet connection is required by the ground station for "
"this to work."
msgstr ""
"使用这些地面站保存已加载的任务或带着已加载任务连接时，都会下载地形数据；在飞行中，若飞机飞入尚未下载数据的区域，飞控会请求数据（前提是地面站能够提供）。地面站可能有先前请求数据的自有缓存，但若在没有缓存数据的区域飞行，地面站需要互联网连接才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:131
#: 33857adc644b436fb30b232ee467398a
msgid ""
"If :ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` bit 0 (value +1) is set, the "
"terrain data will not be downloaded from the ground station."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 :ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` 的位 0（值 +1），则不会从地面站下载地形数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:133
#: 60f73fbd3161455b832aa0c329edb4bc
msgid ""
"While the autopilot will request the terrain data around waypoints and home "
"location, if it is not connected to a GCS that can supply enroute tiles, and"
" if the relevant terrain data is not on the SD Card, the autopilot just "
"interpolates between the terrain elevation of the waypoints. See below:"
msgstr ""
"虽然飞控会请求航点和 home 位置周围的地形数据，但如果未连接能提供沿途图块的地面站，且 SD "
"卡上也没有相关地形数据，飞控只会在各航点的地形高程之间进行插值。见下文："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:136
#: ef6c25d3bee246f18489d545a402bf3a
msgid ""
"If you are not flying with a GCS that can fetch and supply terrain data as "
"the vehicles flies between waypoints, then you may need to load terrain data"
" covering the flight route and/or area for RTL paths manually."
msgstr "如果飞行时没有能在载具于航点间飞行时获取并提供地形数据的地面站，则可能需要手动加载覆盖航线和/或 RTL 路径区域的地形数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:139
#: 4ec7aa3d77be4264aae71ee366d97842
msgid ""
"You can download a set of terrain data tiles at either 100m (SRTM3) or 30m "
"(SRTM1) for any anticipated flight area using this `web utility "
"<https://terrain.ardupilot.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用这个 `网页工具 <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/>`__ 下载任何预期飞行区域的 100 米（SRTM3）或 "
"30 米（SRTM1）地形数据图块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:148
#: 962968343e294746986955c409c53c04
msgid ""
"You may also want to obtain higher resolution data, available from "
"commercial sources online, if you have specialized requirements."
msgstr "如有特殊需求，你也可以从在线商业渠道获取更高分辨率的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:150
#: 7b6907f9edad4e5d953c40979263f186
msgid ""
"It's a very good idea to remove the SD card from the AutoPilot and copy "
"large terrain data sets directly to the /APM/TERRAIN folder from your PC, as"
" copying them via MAVFtp in Mission Planner using a USB or other MAVlink "
"connection is likely to take many, many hours or even days."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议将 SD 卡从飞控中取出，直接从 PC 将大型地形数据集复制到 /APM/TERRAIN 文件夹，因为通过 USB 或其他 MAVlink "
"连接在 Mission Planner 中用 MAVFtp 复制，很可能需要许多小时甚至数天。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:157
#: f863d14b05b0420eb18e25434e71f0cd
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot terrain code has a user settable parameter called "
":ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` which controls the grid spacing "
"which is used for requests for terrain data from the aircraft to the ground "
"station. The default :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` is 100 meters "
"but 30m spacing (SRTM1) data provides a good compromise between accuracy and"
" bandwidth/storage space, and runtime memory requirements. Use "
"``TERRAIN_SPACING`` = 30 meters for most normal use cases."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 地形代码有一个用户可设置的参数 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>`，用于控制飞机向地面站请求地形数据时所用的网格间距。:ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>`"
" 默认为 100 米，但 30 米间距（SRTM1）数据在精度与带宽/存储空间及运行内存需求之间取得了很好的平衡。大多数常规用例请使用 "
"``TERRAIN_SPACING`` = 30 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:164
#: efc312d12014470aa6cb9133a3344737
msgid ""
"Expert users who provide their own terrain data may set a different grid "
"spacing for specialist applications."
msgstr "自备地形数据的专家用户可为特殊应用设置不同的网格间距。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:166
#: f780de0523af47aaae43d2cd798b04ef
msgid ""
"Note that the amount of terrain data kept in memory is directly related to "
"the grid spacing. If you decrease the ``TERRAIN_SPACING`` by a factor of 2 "
"then the amount of terrain area kept in memory is reduced by a factor of 4. "
"This may be an issue on older boards with less memory, but for a newer "
"AutoPilot with 1M of RAM, the :ref:`TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ<TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ>` can "
"be increased to make better use of available memory for caching terrain "
"tiles. The default is 12 but a good value on an STM32-H7 processor would be "
"60 or higher."
msgstr ""
"注意，内存中保存的地形数据量与网格间距直接相关。若将 ``TERRAIN_SPACING`` 减小为原来的 1/2，则内存中保存的地形面积会减小为原来的"
" 1/4。这在内存较小的旧板卡上可能成为问题，但对于拥有 1M RAM 的较新飞控，可增大 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ<TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ>` 以更好地利用可用内存缓存地形图块。默认值为 12，而在 "
"STM32-H7 处理器上 60 或更高是不错的取值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:174
#: 7538a99c4b674eb79b69874582707eb2
msgid ""
"If your AutoPilot has less memory, less storage space, or communication "
"bandwidth might be an issue, it is recommended that you use a "
"``TERRAIN_SPACING`` of 100 meters to prevent the aircraft running off the "
"side of a grid in flight and not having data available."
msgstr ""
"如果你的飞控内存较小、存储空间较少，或通信带宽可能成为问题，建议使用 100 米的 "
"``TERRAIN_SPACING``，以防飞机在飞行中越出网格边缘而没有可用数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:179
#: b043d47160a84e798d129c7b44112ba8
msgid ""
"If the ground station does not have terrain data available at the resolution"
" requested by the aircraft then the ground station will interpolate as "
"necessary to provide the requested grid size."
msgstr "如果地面站没有飞机请求分辨率的地形数据，地面站将进行必要的插值以提供所请求的网格大小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:184
#: c2fbe26b20d140a9abd24623776fd1d0
msgid "Terrain Data Issue - Old Terrain Data"
msgstr "地形数据问题——旧地形数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:185
#: 9073d116aaaa41ce9f3cd23e6a2b04a8
msgid ""
"In early 2026 an issue was identified with terrain data available from "
"terrain.ardupilot.org. The issue was resolved on 24th February 2026. From "
"ArduPilot 4.7, ArduPilot will raise a pre-arm error if it finds older data "
"on the SD Card, or it's served from a ground control station, perhaps from "
"an older cache. It is risky to fly with this old data, but the risks do "
"depend on where you are flying, so you might choose to accept the risk."
msgstr ""
"2026 年初，terrain.ardupilot.org 提供的地形数据被发现存在问题。该问题已于 2026 年 2 月 24 日解决。从 "
"ArduPilot 4.7 起，如果发现 SD 卡上有旧数据，或地面站提供了旧数据（可能来自旧缓存），ArduPilot 会触发解锁前（pre-"
"arm）错误。使用这些旧数据飞行有风险，但风险大小取决于飞行地点，你可以自行选择是否接受该风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:191
#: b156f7aad5d540fb9b8470aaa53b17c9
msgid ""
"If you are running a 4.6.x release or earlier you won’t get the above error "
"message, but that doesn’t mean you are safe. You should:"
msgstr "如果你运行的是 4.6.x 或更早版本，则不会收到上述错误消息，但这并不意味着安全。你应当："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:194
#: 5767848e9a3043ca8829b8ad3487c651
msgid ""
"Delete all the DAT files in the APM/TERRAIN directory on your microSD card "
"then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "删除 microSD 卡 APM/TERRAIN 目录中的所有 DAT 文件，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:195
#: c226d19dc014455aad96aea1b44f186d
msgid ""
"If using Mission Planner or MAVProxy, delete the SRTM data from your Ground "
"Station. If using Mission Planner delete the contents of "
"C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\Mission Planner\\\\srtm"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Mission Planner 或 MAVProxy，请删除地面站上的 SRTM 数据。如果使用 Mission Planner，请删除 "
"C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\Mission Planner\\\\srtm 中的内容"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:196
#: 925d45c3052948b8a63d7891a544548f
msgid ""
"Then either download new data from terrain.ardupilot.org or let the normal "
"automatic terrain download system download new terrain data via your GCS."
msgstr "然后从 terrain.ardupilot.org 下载新数据，或让正常的自动地形下载系统通过你的地面站下载新的地形数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:198
#: e3d9fb500e9244f5a031978f3ce32b2b
msgid ""
"If you are running the 4.7.x release or higher (or you are running the "
"latest master branch) then you should get the above warning if you have old "
"terrain data, but if you are uncertain then the safe thing to do is delete "
"the old DAT files from APM/TERRAIN and download again."
msgstr ""
"如果你运行的是 4.7.x 或更高版本（或正在运行最新的 master 分支），当存在旧地形数据时应会收到上述警告；但如果不确定，安全的做法是删除 "
"APM/TERRAIN 中的旧 DAT 文件并重新下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:200
#: f7bc24c356cf47d38a3c8ab8b814b56d
msgid ""
"In 4.7.x or higher you can set :ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` bit 2"
" (value=4) to override the check and allow you to use old terrain data. If "
"you are confident you are not impacted by the bugs (most locations in the "
"world are unaffected) then this new :ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` "
"bit allows you to fly without the error messages.  We don’t recommend this, "
"but for some vehicles where replacing the terrain data files is difficult "
"this is provided as an option. For example, if you have created your own DAT"
" files from geoTIFF or similar then this would be a way to avoid having to "
"regenerate them. Remember to unset this option bit when you move to newer "
"terrain data."
msgstr ""
"在 4.7.x 或更高版本中，可以设置 :ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` 的位 2（值 "
"=4）来跳过该检查，允许使用旧地形数据。如果你确信不受这些缺陷影响（世界上大多数地点不受影响），这个新的 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` "
"位可以让你在没有错误消息的情况下飞行。我们不推荐这样做，但对于某些难以更换地形数据文件的载具，此项作为一个选项提供。例如，如果你已从 geoTIFF "
"或类似数据自行生成了 DAT 文件，这样可以避免重新生成。换用较新的地形数据后，记得取消该选项位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:207
#: 1de3e6a60919476b8fbdd969296146c9
msgid ""
"When the terrain data issue was resolved, the data sources for both 100m and"
" 30m terrain were switched to JAXA's ALOS. There are 2 dataset versions "
"available:"
msgstr "地形数据问题解决后，100 米和 30 米地形的数据源都切换为 JAXA 的 ALOS。有 2 个数据集版本可用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:209
#: 69985a00178d4e588589dbc85de1aa7a
msgid ""
"SRTM1: Based on JAXA's ALOS dataset and has 30m (1 arc-second) horizontal "
"resolution. It covers all areas between 0 and 84 degrees North/South "
"latitude."
msgstr "SRTM1：基于 JAXA 的 ALOS 数据集，水平分辨率为 30 米（1 弧秒）。覆盖南/北纬 0 到 84 度之间的所有区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:210
#: 493bd58a19a34853825f4f29e5a8d5a8
msgid ""
"SRTM3: Downsampled version of SRTM1 with 100m (3 arc-second) horizontal "
"resolution. It covers all areas between 0 and 84 degrees North/South "
"latitude."
msgstr "SRTM3：SRTM1 的降采样版本，水平分辨率为 100 米（3 弧秒）。覆盖南/北纬 0 到 84 度之间的所有区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:212
#: daacd57d72e94c23a3ffd18e19142377
msgid ""
"This does mean that although we use \"SRTM1\" and \"SRTM3\", to refer to the"
" different data sets, neither of the data sets provided by ArduPilot is "
"actually NASA SRTM (Shuttle Radar Topography Mission Global) data."
msgstr ""
"这意味着，尽管我们用“SRTM1”和“SRTM3”指代这两种不同的数据集，但 ArduPilot 提供的这两个数据集实际上都不是 NASA "
"SRTM（Shuttle Radar Topography Mission Global，航天飞机雷达地形测绘任务）数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:215
#: 4e19cf03ecf0404881ce6d9b72e40d94
msgid ""
"While the original NASA SRTM data had a target vertical accuracy of +/- 16 "
"meters (see `SRTM Mission Specifications "
"<https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/catalog/lpcloud-srtmgl1n-003>`_), the "
"ALOS AW3D30 data generally achieves an accuracy of +/- 5 meters (see `JAXA "
"AW3D30 Validation Report <https://isprs-"
"archives.copernicus.org/articles/XLI-B4/157/2016/isprs-archives-"
"XLI-B4-157-2016.pdf>`_)."
msgstr ""
"原始 NASA SRTM 数据的目标垂直精度为 +/- 16 米（见 `SRTM Mission Specifications "
"<https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/catalog/lpcloud-srtmgl1n-003>`_），而 ALOS"
" AW3D30 数据一般可达 +/- 5 米的精度（见 `JAXA AW3D30 Validation Report <https://isprs-"
"archives.copernicus.org/articles/XLI-B4/157/2016/isprs-archives-"
"XLI-B4-157-2016.pdf>`_）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:222
#: afc14903cd8e460dba9f84ce5f31e311
msgid "Impacts of Downsampling to SRTM3"
msgstr "降采样为 SRTM3 的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:224
#: 2f601f52589b471c8e96bb147fea68bf
msgid ""
"While both datasets are derived from the high-accuracy JAXA ALOS mission, "
"the process of downsampling from the native 30m resolution (SRTM1) to the "
"100m resolution (SRTM3) introduces several issues:"
msgstr ""
"虽然两个数据集都源自高精度的 JAXA ALOS 任务，但从原生 30 米分辨率（SRTM1）降采样到 100 "
"米分辨率（SRTM3）的过程会引入若干问题："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:226
#: 7ab1122483c04f099815a5fc0b42eaa1
msgid ""
"**Vertical Accuracy Loss:** Downsampling involves averaging multiple 30m "
"data points into a single 100m cell. This mathematical smoothing increases "
"the vertical error (RMSE), particularly in rugged or mountainous terrain, "
"making the 100m dataset less precise than the 30m version."
msgstr ""
"**垂直精度损失：** 降采样需要将多个 30 米数据点平均为单个 100 "
"米栅格。这种数学上的平滑会增大垂直误差（RMSE），在崎岖或山区地形中尤为明显，使 100 米数据集的精度低于 30 米版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:227
#: 0b18bc95523f46d897e7b2e521a5bb7f
msgid ""
"**Loss of Sharp Features:** High-resolution details of valleys, ridges, and "
"hills become \"flattened\" or smoothed out. The 30m (SRTM1) version is "
"significantly more reliable at capturing sharp topographic changes that a "
"drone might encounter."
msgstr ""
"**尖锐地形特征丢失：** 山谷、山脊和丘陵的高分辨率细节会被“压平”或平滑掉。30 "
"米（SRTM1）版本在捕捉无人机可能遇到的急剧地形变化方面明显更可靠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:228
#: ea68c4b9cfd14974ad3f3060af506fb9
msgid ""
"**Averaging Errors:** Each ~100m cell in the SRTM3 version represents the "
"average height of an area roughly the size of a city block. Small but "
"critical obstacles—such as a single sharp peak—may be averaged into the "
"surrounding lower terrain, making them effectively \"invisible\" to the "
"autopilot's terrain-following logic."
msgstr ""
"**平均误差：** SRTM3 版本中每个约 100 "
"米的栅格代表大约一个街区大小区域的平均高度。小而关键的障碍物——例如单个尖峰——可能被平均进周围较低的地形中，使其对飞控的地形跟随逻辑而言实际上“不可见”。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:231
#: cd4f27f7bca3439ab3b4f468ec677134
msgid ""
"Regardless of which dataset is used, the terrain database represents a "
"\"surface model\" (including trees/buildings) and can change over time. "
"Always maintain a conservative safety altitude buffer."
msgstr "无论使用哪个数据集，地形数据库表示的都是“表面模型”（包含树木/建筑物），并且可能随时间变化。请始终保持保守的安全高度余量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:233
#: 15d2014e6e1f4555a0f5a8013fa87fe9
msgid ""
"Using terrain data for low flights is not recommended, and if using "
"automatic landing, a rangefinder is recommended for the final approach."
msgstr "不建议使用地形数据进行低空飞行；如果使用自动着陆，建议在最后进近阶段使用测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:236
#: 56361ab0ca2c4965a04af0f93eeaf9b7
msgid "Setting up for terrain following using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 设置地形跟随"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:238
#: 5faa0b349d4a4b3c8bc3ff9e64e08656
msgid ""
"To setup your fixed wing aircraft for terrain following if you are using "
"Mission Planner, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如果使用 Mission Planner，为固定翼飞机设置地形跟随请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:249
#: 60d37470706946e79cede93436b49620
msgid ""
"When the autopilot has finished loading terrain data you should see "
"\"ter_pend\" goes to zero and the current terrain altitude in meters showing"
" up in \"ter_alt\". The \"ter_pend\" value is the number of terrain blocks "
"that the autopilot is waiting to load from the ground station or from the SD"
" Card."
msgstr ""
"飞控加载完地形数据后，你应看到“ter_pend”变为零，且“ter_alt”中显示当前地形高度（米）。“ter_pend”值是飞控正在等待从地面站或 "
"SD 卡加载的地形块数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:255
#: 718c428676e84964974be26f28efddfe
msgid "Terrain Options"
msgstr "地形选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:256
#: 13283904d8534238833a14e4caad77cf
msgid ""
"There are three optional behaviors which can be selected via the "
":ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` bitmask parameter:"
msgstr "可以通过 :ref:`TERRAIN_OPTIONS<TERRAIN_OPTIONS>` 位掩码参数选择三种可选行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:258
#: ed011b679c3a4a01addcdbc6848ff3db
msgid "if bit 0 is set (value+1): downloading of terrain data is halted."
msgstr "设置位 0（值 +1）：停止下载地形数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:259
#: a2d775c8306e40da8ebea8b504efdd63
msgid ""
"if bit 1 is set (value+2): enables using terrain data (via GCS) when no SD "
"card is present."
msgstr "设置位 1（值 +2）：允许在没有 SD 卡时（经由地面站）使用地形数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:260
#: bca69fd8f7a84754b73042be5c8baf3e
msgid "if bit 2 is set (value+4): will accept \"old\" terrain data (see below)"
msgstr "设置位 2（值 +4）：接受“旧”地形数据（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:277
#: 4c90ec3e69fa41c7848b3b5c8a30de7f
msgid "Recommended Settings"
msgstr "推荐设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:280
#: 65d272ae67cc4205bc34908cd515377b
msgid ""
"set :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` to 30 meters for more precise "
"AGL calculations"
msgstr "将 :ref:`TERRAIN_SPACING<TERRAIN_SPACING>` 设为 30 米，以获得更精确的 AGL（离地高度）计算"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:281
#: d3ae349b27834a09a7aa38b231f1b065
msgid ""
"set :ref:`TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ<TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ>` to 60 to load more tiles into "
"memory (RAM)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ<TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ>` 设为 60，以将更多瓦片加载到内存（RAM）中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:282
#: 0da6d661fa4942c290be80f972e3ba9c
msgid ""
"set :ref:`TERRAIN_LOOKAHD<TERRAIN_LOOKAHD>` to 1000 meters unless you have a"
" reason to need more"
msgstr "将 :ref:`TERRAIN_LOOKAHD<TERRAIN_LOOKAHD>` 设为 1000 米，除非有理由需要更大值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-terrain-following.rst:284
#: 13fbd0d7bf264e79a1cc890b1d8eac42
msgid ""
"To avoid high bandwidth consumption due to terrain tiles being sent to the "
"aircraft over your telemetry link, especially if you often fly in different "
"locations, it's also highly recommended to download the terrain around your "
"planned flight area in the /APM/TERRAIN folder on the SD Card on the "
"AutoPilot."
msgstr ""
"为避免地形图块通过数传链路发送到飞机造成的高带宽消耗（尤其是经常在不同地点飞行时），也强烈建议将计划飞行区域周边的地形数据下载到飞控 SD 卡的 "
"/APM/TERRAIN 文件夹中。"
